# Third-party repos vendored ONLY as reading material for design comparison.
# Kept out of history so a public repo never ships someone else's tree (and
# its licence obligations) by accident through a broad `git add`.
#
# CAUTION, measured 2026-08-13: being gitignored keeps it out of git, NOT out
# of the tools. A bare `bun test` scans the whole tree and RUNS the 63 test
# files under sandbox-runtime-main, which crashes Bun on Windows
# ("panic: integer does not fit in destination type"), and the tsconfig
# discipline walker picks up its tsconfig.json too. Hence the gate is
# `bun test tests`, never a bare `bun test`. Nothing enforces this exclusion
# beyond that convention -- do not read this comment as a guarantee.
desktop/docs/reference/
